&lt;li&gt;Excellent technical, analytical and troubleshooting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and in-depth knowledge of databases and data handling (MS-SQL, Elasticsearch, YML, JSON, XML)&lt;/li&gt;
