&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in platform engineering, observability, and provisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to develop and implement a strategic vision for platform services, observability, and provisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cyber security principles, governance, and compliance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
